        <h1>About Us</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Mission Section -->
    <div class="mb-5">
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>
            At StudyMate, our mission is simple: To help students stay organized, reduce stress, and improve productivity through effective task management.
            We believe that when students stay on top of their assignments and deadlines, they perform better and feel more confident.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Story Section -->
    <div class="mb-5">
        <h3>How It Started</h3>
        <p>
            StudyMate began as a small class project as our team realized that with the constant demands of school, many students struggle to keep track of their tasks and deadlines. 
            Juggling multiple courses, extracurricular activities, and personal commitments can be overwhelming. We wanted to create a solution that would make task management easier and 
            more intuitive for students. StudyMate was born out of this need. We wanted to build a platform that not only helps students organize their tasks but also motivates them to stay focused and 
            achieve their academic goals. With StudyMate, students can easily add, track, and prioritize their assignments all in one place.
            StudyMate is a platform made for students by students.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <div class="mb-5">
        <h3>What StudyMate Helps You Do</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>📅 Track assignments and due dates</li>
            <li>📊 Monitor your progress over time</li>
            <li>📝 Organize tasks by priority and subject</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Values Section -->
    <div class="mb-5">
        <h3>Our Core Values</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>💡 Simplicity- Tools that are easy to use and student-friendly</li>
            <li>🎓 Student Success - Designed with real student needs in mind</li>
            <li>📈 Productivity - Helping you stay focused and achieve more</li>
            <li>🤝 Support - We are here to help students every step of the way</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

